# SECTION 4 — THE EYE   b93-103   (2:50 - 3:30)
# No drums.  D major (the storm's last blow) heard from inside:
# D | D/F# | Bm | Gmaj7 | Gm6 | D/A | Bbmaj7 | Gm6/Bb | Asus4 | A | (breath).
# One slow high arpeggio (Soft Touch), women Oo, a far bass line.

# -- the drums are gone. One slow high arpeggio (Soft Touch) over women's choir
# -- Oo and a far bass line; D major darkens (Gm6, Bb) toward A.  b103: silence,
# -- the leader's kakegoe on beat 4 calls everybody back.
== b93-103 [The Eye] ==
